{
    "title": "Blink: Captions & Teleprompter",
    "description": "Leveraging the power of AI, Blink Captions by Vozo offers you innovative features to automatically add captions and subtitles accurately. You can also translate captions to other languages in a click with Blink Captions by Vozo, and it allows you to edit and customize captions 10x easier and in exceptional quality!\r\n\r\nHere's what you can unlock with Blink Captions by Vozo:\r\n\r\nAI Captions: Automated, Stylish Captions and Subtitles for Talking Videos\r\nUse speech-to-text technology to auto-add captions (aka autocap) with 99.97% accuracy, significantly upgrading the readability and interest level of your talking videos or reels. Blink Captions supports various file types and 28 languages, with captions 100% customizable at the sentence or batch level.\r\n\r\nLyrics Mode (New Feature Released!)\r\nFrom Pop to Rap, Blink Captions accurately detects and transcribes your song lyrics. Add stunning captions to your music video with just one click.\r\n\r\nAI Translate: One-click Translate Captions to Another Language\r\nThinking about expanding your audience but lack the time and skills to translate captions? No worries! Blink Captions can get the translation of subtitles done instantly. Select your original and target languages, click \"\"translate\"\" and your translated video is ready for export. We support 17 mainstream languages and dialects.\r\n\r\n200+ Trendy Captions Styles to Make Your Talking Video Stunning\r\nCool captions styles make your videos or reels eye-catching! We research the latest trends in subtitle style and create 200+ presets for your choice, including font, color, size, background, and animations. All styles can be further modified in Blink Captions.\r\n\r\nAI Trim: Automatically Remove Fillers and Silence in Captions and Video \r\nIn one click, filler words and silent parts can be removed from both your captions and video, making talking video or reel editing super easy, smooth, and fluent!\r\n\r\nAI Zoom and Highlight\r\nMark the area you want to stand out in your talking video and when you want it to pop in the captions. Blink Captions will automatically zoom into this area at your specified timing\u2014a unique way to draw attention! You can also choose to highlight any part of your captions.\r\n\r\nAI Title\r\nGet automatic, personalized talking video titles that fit right into your content. Let Blink Captions help you create attractive titles!\r\n\r\nAI Teleprompter\r\nForget memorizing scripts. Our prompter automatically scrolls at your talking speed. when recording talking videos, allowing natural delivery and eye contact.\r\n\r\nAI Script\r\nJot down your thoughts, and our AI turns them into a finished script, allowing you to focus on delivering your message with Blink Captions!\r\n\r\nAI Background\r\nBlur your background or switch it in real-time with Blink Captions' virtual green screen. No need for physical green screens or additional editing.\r\n\r\nFun Emojis, GIFs & Sound Effects\r\nBlink Captions spice up your talking videos with emojis, GIFs, and sounds\u2014all it takes is a click.\r\n\r\nAI Noise Reducer\r\nGet clear talking audio with AI-powered noise reduction. Freely adjust background sound levels to suit your video needs!\r\n\r\nAI Beauty Filters for the Perfect Look\r\nUse beauty filters to enhance your appearance in videos.\r\n\r\nWe can't wait to see what you'll create with Blink Captions by Vozo! Should you have any feedback or suggestions, contact us at blink-support@blinkvideo.ai.\r\n\r\nTerms of service: https://www.blinkvideo.ai/terms\r\nPrivacy policy: https://www.blinkvideo.ai/privacy_policy",
    "descriptionHTML": "Leveraging the power of AI, Blink Captions by Vozo offers you innovative features to automatically add captions and subtitles accurately. You can also translate captions to other languages in a click with Blink Captions by Vozo, and it allows you to edit and customize captions 10x easier and in exceptional quality!<br><br>Here&#39;s what you can unlock with Blink Captions by Vozo:<br><br>AI Captions: Automated, Stylish Captions and Subtitles for Talking Videos<br>Use speech-to-text technology to auto-add captions (aka autocap) with 99.97% accuracy, significantly upgrading the readability and interest level of your talking videos or reels. Blink Captions supports various file types and 28 languages, with captions 100% customizable at the sentence or batch level.<br><br>Lyrics Mode (New Feature Released!)<br>From Pop to Rap, Blink Captions accurately detects and transcribes your song lyrics. Add stunning captions to your music video with just one click.<br><br>AI Translate: One-click Translate Captions to Another Language<br>Thinking about expanding your audience but lack the time and skills to translate captions? No worries! Blink Captions can get the translation of subtitles done instantly. Select your original and target languages, click &quot;&quot;translate&quot;&quot; and your translated video is ready for export. We support 17 mainstream languages and dialects.<br><br>200+ Trendy Captions Styles to Make Your Talking Video Stunning<br>Cool captions styles make your videos or reels eye-catching! We research the latest trends in subtitle style and create 200+ presets for your choice, including font, color, size, background, and animations. All styles can be further modified in Blink Captions.<br><br>AI Trim: Automatically Remove Fillers and Silence in Captions and Video <br>In one click, filler words and silent parts can be removed from both your captions and video, making talking video or reel editing super easy, smooth, and fluent!<br><br>AI Zoom and Highlight<br>Mark the area you want to stand out in your talking video and when you want it to pop in the captions. Blink Captions will automatically zoom into this area at your specified timing\u2014a unique way to draw attention! You can also choose to highlight any part of your captions.<br><br>AI Title<br>Get automatic, personalized talking video titles that fit right into your content. Let Blink Captions help you create attractive titles!<br><br>AI Teleprompter<br>Forget memorizing scripts. Our prompter automatically scrolls at your talking speed. when recording talking videos, allowing natural delivery and eye contact.<br><br>AI Script<br>Jot down your thoughts, and our AI turns them into a finished script, allowing you to focus on delivering your message with Blink Captions!<br><br>AI Background<br>Blur your background or switch it in real-time with Blink Captions&#39; virtual green screen. No need for physical green screens or additional editing.<br><br>Fun Emojis, GIFs &amp; Sound Effects<br>Blink Captions spice up your talking videos with emojis, GIFs, and sounds\u2014all it takes is a click.<br><br>AI Noise Reducer<br>Get clear talking audio with AI-powered noise reduction. Freely adjust background sound levels to suit your video needs!<br><br>AI Beauty Filters for the Perfect Look<br>Use beauty filters to enhance your appearance in videos.<br><br>We can&#39;t wait to see what you&#39;ll create with Blink Captions by Vozo! Should you have any feedback or suggestions, contact us at blink-support@blinkvideo.ai.<br><br>Terms of service: https://www.blinkvideo.ai/terms<br>Privacy policy: https://www.blinkvideo.ai/privacy_policy",
